## Key Concepts
- GPU resource isolation using MIG (Multi-Instance GPU) on NVIDIA hardware
- NVML metrics for granular GPU telemetry
- Triton Inference Server integration patterns
- Memory fragmentation versus transient spikes
- Kernel contention and cross-tenant interference detection
- Burst traffic modeling with per-tenant quotas
- Horizontal and vertical autoscaling strategies
- SLO validation and reliability signal collection

